\subsection{Definitions and mathematical statement}
\paragraph{Statement recorded in the supplied source.}
For every $\epsilon >0$, does the half-wave propagator satisfy ||exp(it $\operatorname{sqrt}(-Delta))f||_L3(R3$ x $[1,2])<=C_\epsilon ||(1-Delta)^{\epsilon /2}f||_L3(R3)$ for every Schwartz f?

\subsection{Short English statement}
For every $\epsilon >0$, does the half-wave propagator satisfy ||exp(it $\operatorname{sqrt}(-Delta))f||_L3(R3$ x $[1,2])<=C_\epsilon ||(1-Delta)^{\epsilon /2}f||_L3(R3)$ for every Schwartz f?

